        "id": 1892347
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-02-04T14:13:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It\u0027s recommended to avoid ptr2int2ptr roundtrips. Why not use `*mut ()` here instead?",
      "revId": "41f273cf6cb577478ece24b5d67dfba9fc453120",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
