      "author": {
        "id": 1019013
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-02-05T15:43:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I did so simply because `ptr` can\u0027t be sent across the thread. `data` is originated from the FFI function, so this seemed to be the simplest workaround.\n\nCould you recommend me a more Rust way for this? It would be a great help.",
      "parentUuid": "876769be_4c11e4fc",
      "revId": "41f273cf6cb577478ece24b5d67dfba9fc453120",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
